  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - No fans, louvres, ducts or other external plant shall be installed without the prior approval of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - Suitable arrangements will be made for the provision of refuse storage on site before the units are occupied.",
    "Condition : 5 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in the east or west facing wall of the extension hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - The roof area of the extension hereby permitted shall not be used as a balcony, roof garden or similar amenity area without the grant of further specific permission from the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - Before the development is commenced a scheme for soundproofing between ground floor and first floor, and between 8 and 12 Stile Hall Gardens party wall will be submitted and approved by the council before the development is first begun.",
